#: README.md:1
msgid "A tutorial on installing PLUMED"
msgstr "PLUMED インストール Tutorial"

#: README.md:3
msgid ""
"This repository contains instructions with various levels of detail for "
"installing PLUMED."
msgstr "このリポジトリには、詳しさの異なるインストール手順があります。"

#: README.md:5
msgid ""
"The file NAVIGATION.md that is shown on the PLUMED website is a modification"
" of the one in this repository. Modifications to this file are generated by "
"the python script `build.py`. This script uses the information in "
"`md_notes.yml` to construct a graph that contains information about the "
"various MD codes that can PLUMED can be used with. If you have implemented "
"an interface between PLUMED and another MD code please feel free to modify "
"this file. It should be self explanatory."
msgstr ""
"サイトの NAVIGATION.md は、ここのものを `build.py` で変更しています。`md_notes.yml` から対応 MD の "
"Graph を作ります。新しい Interface を実装したら、このファイルを編集してください。形式は見ればわかるはずです。"

#: README.md:11
msgid ""
"The file `Installation.md` that is shown on the PLUMED tutorial website is "
"constructed by the python script `build.py.` This script takes the "
"information in the file `Installation.md` and the directories `computers`, "
"`sections` and `Modals` and merges it all together."
msgstr ""
"サイトの `Installation.md` は `build.py.` "
"が、`Installation.md`、`computers`、`sections`、`Modals` を統合して作ります。"

#: README.md:15
msgid ""
"If you have specific information about installing PLUMED on a particular "
"machine you can add an additional file in the `computers` directory. The "
"option to show that information will appear in the dropdown menu that "
"appears when the user asks to see how to install PLUMED on a cluster."
msgstr "特定マシンの情報は `computers` にファイルを追加できます。Cluster インストールの Drop-down に表示されます。"

#: README.md:18
msgid ""
"The `Modals` directory has all the content that appears in pop-up windows. "
"If you would like to create a new pop-up window then you can add a further "
"file in that directory (please ensure that the file has no special "
"characters in the name and that it is named <name>.md). You then need to add"
" an instruction on when to open that pop up."
msgstr "`Modals` は Pop-up の内容です。追加するには、特殊文字なしの <name>.md を置き、開く条件を指定します。"

#: README.md:22
msgid ""
"Lastly, the file `options.yml` contains the information that is used to "
"construct the dropdown menu that tells users the various ways they can build"
" the code. The questions are what appear in the dropdown menu. What is shown"
" when that dropdown menu is selected then listed in the sections part. The "
"various sections in here refer to files that are contained in the `sections`"
" directory."
msgstr ""
"`options.yml` はビルド方法の Drop-down を定義します。Question が選択肢、sections "
"が選択後の表示で、`sections` 内のファイルに対応します。"
